{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:0.1", "PA_ja_266:0.2", "PA_ja_266:0.3"], "en": "Jātaka Tikanipāta, Padumavagga (The Lotus Chapter)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:0.4", "PA_ja_266:1.1"], "en": "6. The Vātaggasindhava Jātaka “By that [cause] you were emaciated and pale,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:1.2"], "en": "by which food was not pleasing to you;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:1.3"], "en": "“Here is that husband who has come;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:1.4"], "en": "why do you flee now?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:2.1"], "en": "“If, however, by this very first [meal]...”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:2.2"], "en": "Familiarity arises,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:2.3"], "en": "and the reputation of women declines;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:2.4"], "en": "therefore, dear father, I am fleeing.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:3.1", "PA_ja_266:3.2"], "en": "She who does not wish to accept one born of a famous family when he has arrived,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:3.3"], "en": "will grieve for a long time.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:3.4"], "en": "\"Like the horse Vātagga, Bhaddalī.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_266:4.1"], "en": "This is the sixth Jātaka, the Vātagga-sindhava-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
